{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/953491-question-about-sealings","id":953491,"title":"Question about Sealings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-18T17:07:54-07:00","id":953491,"title":"Question about Sealings","content":"I noticed that Pishogues from first edition survived as an option for enhanced Sealings, and I have some questions about how they function. <br /> <br /> Specifically, the text says you can cast &quot;A contract&quot; and while presumably this is meant to be a curse like Paralyzing Shudder or an attack like Lord's Dread Gaze, it is not required to be. I assume that attempting to use a contract that can't normally affect another person simply fizzles, but what if you choose a beneficial or neutral contract? The Wyrd dislikes pledge breakers, but it also thrives on weird loopholes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T00:27:11-07:00","id":953706,"title":"","content":"I remember that being a &quot;trick&quot; suggested in first edition. Create a pledge that gives a benefit to a friend when they do something highly specific to break it. As a bonus, you could sense they broke the pledge and rush to their aid.<br /> <br /> Whether this is permissible in 2e is probably up to your ST. Whether it's intended? I could not guess, but it's interesting to note that breaking a Sealing does not give the Oathbreaker condition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/478-intrepid-vector","name":"Intrepid Vector","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar478_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T14:03:43-07:00","id":954032,"title":"","content":"I'm curious as to how the final product will deal with this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}